  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Advancing formalisation and mercury reduction in artisanal and smal-scale gold mining in Cameroon</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project objective is to reduce the use of mercury and increase incomes in the ASGM sector in Cameroon through a holistic, multisectoral integrated formalisation approach, and increased access to finance leading to the adoption of sustainable mercury-free technologies and access to traceable gold supply chains. The proposed project responds to and contribute to the planetGOLD global programme.</narrative>
  </description>
